{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/c_CR2c5pbCZxAsU_z8FRyQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:09.975367+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/c_CR2c5pbCZxAsU_z8FRyQ","html":"<div><p><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/IdScEAj8r0Gx2UY8rK3pj4rIFagKOaX3st8ERvOBD0YgBz5LfNMEAicthaxtcx5mTJVsPetFPWQYd5yMwOM9KAA/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;tp=webp\"/></span><span></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/IdScEAj8r0Fk4tiaWF5PCqJ79ibMebytWl9KWUMZ5Yiciaq1x1dqL30zAWMyv3KrdCN090gbSZCFbrKj9gHMMJawFA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><em><strong><span>PART 01</span></strong></em></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>导  言</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span><span>生物医学工程是一门综合工程学、物理学、生物学、化学、材料学和医学的新兴交叉学科</span>，<span>其目标是用工程技术方法来解决临床医学问题</span>。深圳是我国最具影响力的医疗器械产业聚集地之一。医疗器械产业是各领域高新技术充分交叉与融合的综合技术产业，已经成为深圳高科技尖端水平的标志产业之一。绝大部分企业都聚集在深圳大学周边10公里内，地缘优势显著。</span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>近年来，<span>深圳大学生物医学工程学科发展迅速，形成了完善而独具特色的研究生培养方案与体系，学生就业与深造前景广阔</span>。研究生学习期间可被推送至名校（哈佛大学、北卡罗来纳大学、香港大学等）交流学习。硕士毕业生大部分就业于迈瑞、新产业、理邦、联影、腾讯、华为、百度、商汤等知名企业，并迅速成长为技术骨干；部分进入美国约翰·霍普金斯大学、伦斯勒理工学院、北卡罗来纳大学、香港中文大学和香港大学等高校继续深造。</span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>热忱欢迎有志于投身生物医学工程学科和医疗器械产业的优秀学子报名参加本届暑期学校，进一步深入了解深圳大学医学部生物医学工程学院！</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><em><strong><span>PART 02</span></strong></em></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>学院介绍</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span> </span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span> 欢迎优秀学子 </span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span> 报名参加本届暑期学校</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span><br/></span><span>深圳大学生物医学工程学科于2006年创立，并成立生物医学工程系，归属信息工程学院，2007年开始招收研究生，2008年开始招收本科生。2009年生物医学工程系合并到新成立的医学院，2015年成立生物医学工程学院。学院下设医疗电子、医学信息工程、医学检验技术、分子影像四个系。学院现有专职教师70人，70%以上具有海外留学或工作经历，学缘结构国际化，教师队伍年轻化，90%以上是深圳市高层次人才计划获得者。专任教师中包括俄罗斯工程院外籍院士1名、国家级专家2名、AIMBE Fellow 1名、教育部教指委委员1名、国家特殊津贴专家1名、国家级青年人才7名、入选全球前2%顶尖科学家榜单（2024版）14人、珠江青年学者1名、广东省青年拔尖人才2名等。此外，有高级实验师3人，实验员3人。学院在读本科生457人，在读研究生522人。</span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/IdScEAj8r0Fuq5zNuAj7v683ehuTyNWbKQE2P1CONFk3miauZCI8Le8YzjsXPTwS9wHrDibVIsZoIzDNylpt4ESw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>在学科创始人<span>陈思平</span>教授的带领下，深圳大学生物医学工程<span>学科发展迅速</span>，先后建立了<span>深圳市生物医学工程重点实验室</span>（2006年）、<span>生物医学工程一级学科硕士点</span>（2006年）、<span>广东省生物医学信息检测与超声成像重点实验室</span>（2011年）、<span>医学超声关键技术国家地方联合实验室</span>（2011年），并获批<span>广东省优势重点学科</span>（2012年）、<span>生物医学工程一级学科博士点</span>（2018年）和<span>电子信息（生物医学工程方向）专业学位博士点</span>（2021年），获批<span>生物医学工程博士后科研流动站</span>（2019年），并首批入选<span>国家级一流本科专业建设点</span>（2020年）。在教育部第四轮和第五轮<span>学科评估中位列全国第15名，广东省第2名</span>。2024年软科排名全国第12名，并进入软科世界一流学科排名前50名。近三年，承担各级科研项目百余项，研究经费合计超亿元，经费充足，科研设备总值近亿元。</span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_png/IdScEAj8r0Fk4tiaWF5PCqJ79ibMebytWljygQDdKCuGRqLM2Yavics789kee45Zzx9icCw0h9iatu55iapleaSy44eg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>深圳大学生物医学工程学科发展历程</span></span></p><p><span><span>【点击查看大图】</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>教研科学平台 </span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>↓ ↓ ↓</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><span>🎈医学超声关键技术国家地方联合工程实验室（全国唯一医学超声国家级实验室）</span></p><p><span>🎈广东省生物医学信息检测与超声成像重点实验室</span></p><p><span>🎈生物医学工程教学实验中心（广东省高等学校省级实验教学示范中心）</span></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/ZYtz1MsSQ4RTbytdiaPzIMoicwianRB9t8ZUZic1pDp0mgvl6Ems385uIZmXaibj9Gxxhy9NIv8kRs8DX275yboRQ0g/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><em><strong><span>PART 03</span></strong></em></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>研究方向</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span> </span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span> 01 医学超声 </span></span></strong></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>主要研究方向：</span><span>新型超声换能器、超声治疗新技术、超声成像与智能诊断新方法、高性能彩超关键技术</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>02 医学图像处理</span></span><span><br/></span></strong></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>主要研究方向：</span><span>智能医学超声、计算机辅助诊断和介入、医学影像技术在癌症和大脑疾病中的应用、医学大数据人工智能分析及临床应用</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>03 脑机智能与神经影像</span></span></strong></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>主要研究方向：</span><span>跨物种多尺度神经信息处理、脑认知功能与神经精神疾病研究、脑机接口与神经调控、类脑器官、类脑智能与类脑模拟</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>04 体外诊断技术</span></span></strong></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span><span>主要研究方向：</span><span>体外诊断仪器新方法与新技术、体外诊断仪器研发、体外诊断生物标志物新方法、深度学习理论在智能化诊断仪器中的应用</span></span></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>05 生命信息监测</span></span></strong></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>主要研究方向：</span><span>电生理信号监测、呼吸气体与呼吸功能监测、麻醉深度监测、新型传感与监护技术、生命支持与医学仪器设计</span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>06 </span></span><span><span>医疗电子与康复工程</span></span></strong></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>主要研究方向：</span><span>医疗电子及嵌入式技术、运动康复评估、康复机器人、智能辅助器具与脑机接口、医学成像新技术与新方法、病理嗓音辅助AI诊断、新型纳米材料人工喉声学器件原型</span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>07 </span></span><span><span>分子影像与纳米医疗</span></span></strong></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>主要研究方向：</span><span>分子影像、智能诊疗剂、靶向药物递送系统、功能材料合成及生物医学应用、纳米生物学效应</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>3D生物打印</span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>08 </span></span><span><span>生物医学光学成像与传感</span></span></strong></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>主要研究方向：</span><span>多光子显微成像</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>超分辨显微成像</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>活体成像与示踪</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>光学生物传感器应用</span></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong